{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:603ec399de32fff0","name":"Security Bracing","source":{"id":"source:reference-603ec399de32fff0","title":"Security Bracing","revision":19757,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:33:26Z","sha256":"f07538695d14419ce86d87c72d9597ab2eea9016398e266f4d5bc35e99475a7d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19757","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Security%20Bracing&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-603ec399de32fff0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}," "]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Gargantuan or Larger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000 (Base)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Security Bracing entails a series of internal bulkheads and clamps designed to protect a section of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},"- even if the ship as a whole is destroyed. Only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Passenger Conversions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Passenger_Conversions?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Escape Pods"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Escape_Pods"}," can benefit from Security Bracing. When the ship reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," by an attack that deals damage equal to or greater than its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," (thus destroying the ship), subtract the ship's DR from the damage dealt to anyone in an area protected by Security Bracing. Anyone outside this area takes damage equal to one-half the amount that exceeded the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", as normal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Security Bracing is common in big luxury liners and diplomatic transport vessels.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
